    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You reshape a set of nonmagical clothing that no one else is wearing. You decide its color, cut, decoration, and form, though the result can’t be worth more than 15 GP; a tattered Robe can become Fine Clothes, for example, or the reverse. When the spell’s duration ends, the clothing returns to its original form.</p>",
